<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton buys Armed Response for 29 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Klipton buys Armed Response for 29 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security group Klipton Ltd said on Friday it had acquired the Armed Response Group for approximately 29 million rand.</p>
<p>Klipton already owns the Sentry Security company and the said the integration of the two groups would quickly yield benefits to clients and shareholders.</p>
</text>
